{
  "_doc": "VR source -> game control. gameControl must exist in Sandbox.Game MyControlsSpace (checked by preflight). context: foot = character on foot (head-steered), seat = in a cockpit/seat, both. mode: level = held, pulse = one press (the sources named dpad_*/bump_* are rate limited so holding does not spam), analog = proportional value. Movement and turning are not here: the left stick drives the engine's position delta and the head (plus right stick) drives rotation, see VrInput. The D-pad presses real keyboard keys (gameControl KEY:<MyKeys name>): down = Z, up = F, right = L, left = G, so they do whatever the player bound those keys to.",
